# AIDE SESSION

Pipeline-position log for the in-flight feature. This is the canonical
cold-start protocol for the next agent reorienting on this project — it
captures the current architectural intent, the anti-regression invariants
every build phase must hold, and where the cycle paused. It is NOT
historical commentary; superseded design decisions are cut, not annotated.

Lifecycle: this file lives at `.aide/session.aide`, survives multiple
build/QA/fix cycles within a single feature lifecycle, and is deleted by
the maintainer agent only when the feature is fully completed and the
pipeline is no longer in use. See [.aide/docs/session-aide.md](./docs/session-aide.md)
for the full specification of this artifact.

---

